WEBVTT

00:07.134 --> 00:09.624
Welcome!
To
Kanocho

00:27.924 --> 00:30.014
What are you wishing for?

00:35.894 --> 00:37.364
It's a secret.

00:39.264 --> 00:42.264
Oh. You have to keep your wish a secret, huh?

00:50.284 --> 00:53.114
So these stones make wishes come true?

00:56.454 --> 01:00.194
Say, can I wish for something, too?

01:00.194 --> 01:01.584
Sure!

01:13.934 --> 01:15.304
Karada!

01:17.204 --> 01:18.504
Big Brother Hiro!

01:19.604 --> 01:22.414
What are you doing in a place like this?

01:22.414 --> 01:24.344
I was making a wish.

01:24.344 --> 01:25.384
A wish?

01:25.384 --> 01:26.644
Yes!

01:54.844 --> 01:58.244
Something reached for but cannot be grasped...

01:59.584 --> 02:03.644
Something that strays from that hand,
going far away...

02:04.724 --> 02:09.154
People will always pursue such things.

02:10.094 --> 02:13.424
And before long, become lost.

02:19.534 --> 02:23.474
This is our story of one such summer.

02:41.654 --> 02:43.094
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

02:43.094 --> 02:46.764
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow
The children's graffiti

02:46.764 --> 02:47.224
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

02:47.534 --> 02:51.194
That has blossomed on the asphalt

02:51.964 --> 02:55.594
Shimmers in the waves of heat

02:56.434 --> 02:59.274
And has begun to walk

02:59.404 --> 03:04.244
At that promised hill

03:04.244 --> 03:07.874
That no one knows

03:08.414 --> 03:13.124
Encounter the miraculous time called "today"

03:13.124 --> 03:17.894
That comes only once - feel it

03:17.894 --> 03:22.064
Chase the flowing clouds

03:22.064 --> 03:26.404
Even now, they seem in your grasp

03:26.404 --> 03:30.774
A premonition, heart beating with excitement

03:30.774 --> 03:35.404
A destiny that has begun to move

03:35.514 --> 03:39.884
So bright that you awaken

03:39.884 --> 03:43.914
Hotter even than the morning sun

03:44.154 --> 03:48.054
Sparkling without end

03:48.394 --> 03:55.694
Embraced in the season of light

04:05.404 --> 04:07.644
IOKAWA Hiro
Karada

04:07.644 --> 04:07.874
IOKAWA Hiro
Karada
Hiro!

04:07.874 --> 04:08.844
Hiro!

04:10.544 --> 04:12.074
It's morning!

04:13.084 --> 04:14.774
Wake up please!

04:21.954 --> 04:23.554
Good morning.

04:23.794 --> 04:25.424
Good morning.

04:25.424 --> 04:28.094
Our List of Promises
- No fighting
- Always be polite Breakfast Duties
- No secrets Odd-numbered days: Karada
- Eat meals together Even-numbered days: Hiro
- Don't treat people like kids
- Answer loud and clear

04:29.734 --> 04:32.664
Isn't it my turn to cook breakfast?

04:38.044 --> 04:39.804
We're going to the beach today!

04:40.814 --> 04:44.764
The Wishing Stones

04:45.144 --> 04:47.274
Kanocho Station

04:51.254 --> 04:52.284
Jeez...

04:52.284 --> 04:52.654
Kanocho
Station
Jeez...

04:52.654 --> 04:54.694
Kanocho
Station
This really stinks.

04:54.694 --> 04:55.554
Kanocho
Station

04:55.554 --> 04:59.014
Kanocho
Station
All my friends are in Tokyo or
overseas or whatever, but I...

04:59.224 --> 05:02.064
What are you talking about?
You're happy to be here.

05:02.064 --> 05:05.204
Yeah, right! Anyway, Sis, who asked YOU to-

05:05.204 --> 05:07.134
Amino!

05:19.814 --> 05:22.944
See? It's a good thing I came after all, right?

05:23.954 --> 05:25.184
Huh?

05:36.934 --> 05:40.574
This is Hiro's friend, Shoko Nogami.

05:40.574 --> 05:42.064
Sorry for intruding...

05:45.174 --> 05:46.304
No problem.

05:50.044 --> 05:52.784
How long has it been since
I've been to the beach?!

05:52.784 --> 05:55.114
Speaking of... Hey lokawa, can you even swim?

05:55.114 --> 05:55.954
Huh?

05:55.954 --> 05:57.784
I-I can swim just fine!

05:57.784 --> 05:59.024
Oh really?

05:59.024 --> 06:00.154
Yes, really!

06:00.154 --> 06:03.154
You know, I can't even IMAGINE you swimming.

06:03.154 --> 06:04.994
That's just mean!

06:05.864 --> 06:08.464
So you and Hiro were friends?

06:08.464 --> 06:11.664
Not so much "friends" as...

06:11.664 --> 06:15.624
Well, acquaintances, maybe.
He helped me out when I was in America.

06:16.334 --> 06:18.704
Just a little, till she got the hang of things.

06:21.314 --> 06:23.614
When did you come back?

06:23.614 --> 06:27.714
Only just recently. I haven't really
finished unpacking.

06:27.714 --> 06:29.874
And I still have to look for a job.

06:30.214 --> 06:32.384
Why did you come to this town?

06:35.424 --> 06:38.154
Because I thought I wouldn't
run into anyone here...

06:39.364 --> 06:42.334
That I could start over from scratch.

06:50.604 --> 06:52.094
Would you like to come to the beach?

06:53.004 --> 06:57.464
We're all going this Sunday.
Won't you come with us?

07:00.484 --> 07:02.814
Why did I even come?

07:19.034 --> 07:21.074
Yeesh, what a lame-o!

07:21.074 --> 07:23.704
You'll be in middle school next year,
but you're still using a floatie?!

07:23.704 --> 07:25.404
Un-friggin'-real!

07:26.844 --> 07:29.834
But Amino, even your big sister...

07:33.584 --> 07:36.144
I swear! Amino!

07:37.584 --> 07:40.324
He tries to act big, but he's still just a kid.

07:40.324 --> 07:44.054
Sorry. He's quite in love with Karada.

07:44.524 --> 07:46.464
Well, well.

07:46.564 --> 07:48.624
Still, isn't it a little soon for that?

07:48.834 --> 07:52.604
Oh, my. I had my first love when I was four!

07:52.604 --> 07:55.104
Also, I'm here to distract you...

07:55.104 --> 07:56.764
To keep you from interfering.

07:57.944 --> 07:59.244
Looks like you might succeed.

07:59.244 --> 08:02.404
Still, I wonder if today
I didn't just get in the way...

08:06.014 --> 08:09.214
I'm a terrible swimmer.
Please, don't hold back on my account.

08:16.554 --> 08:17.494
Here!

08:22.134 --> 08:22.964
Here!

08:24.104 --> 08:25.124
Got it!

08:25.504 --> 08:27.964
All right! Iokawa!

08:43.714 --> 08:45.814
The heck are you doing?

08:48.454 --> 08:50.324
Hurry up and take my hand.

08:50.594 --> 08:51.894
Thank you.

08:52.964 --> 08:55.594
For being kind to my little sister.

08:56.964 --> 08:58.224
(Sorry... )

09:08.474 --> 09:08.914
Takoyaki
Yukisobu
Orange
Iced Juice
Beer Coffee

09:08.914 --> 09:10.584
Takoyaki
Yukisobu
Orange
Iced Juice
Beer Coffee
Um...

09:10.584 --> 09:10.784
Um...

09:10.784 --> 09:17.454
One cola, a beer, some edamame beans,
an orange juice, an oolong tea and...

09:17.454 --> 09:18.154
- Cold
- Beer
- Edamame beans
- Orange juice
- Oolong tea
- Salted, overnight-dried
salmon

09:18.154 --> 09:20.694
- Cold
- Beer
- Edamame beans
- Orange juice
- Oolong tea
- Salted, overnight-dried
salmon
Salted, overnight-dried salmon...

09:22.094 --> 09:23.714
That's gotta be Toko.

09:23.924 --> 09:25.584
This is SO good!

09:27.334 --> 09:30.334
Karada, you made all this yourself?

09:30.334 --> 09:33.204
Yes! Cooking is my specialty!

09:33.334 --> 09:36.034
Say, these meatballs are homemade, too?

09:36.034 --> 09:39.074
Yes! I tried mixing in a little bit of tofu.

09:39.074 --> 09:41.504
Still, these omelettes are pretty salty.

09:44.444 --> 09:46.714
Quit being a wise-ass.

09:46.714 --> 09:49.214
What do you want from me?! It's the truth.

09:49.214 --> 09:51.274
That's how Hiro likes it.

09:51.784 --> 09:56.014
It's one of his favorites:
Salt-flavored mini omelettes.

09:57.864 --> 09:59.024
Oh.

09:59.024 --> 10:01.994
You cook every day, don't you?

10:01.994 --> 10:05.264
You're bound to start making things
how he likes them.

10:15.114 --> 10:16.644
Doesn't it taste good?

10:16.644 --> 10:17.714
Huh?

10:17.714 --> 10:20.384
Oh, no. It's very good.

10:20.384 --> 10:21.584
I'm glad!

10:21.584 --> 10:26.424
They're flavored only with salt?
It tastes like you've used something else.

10:26.424 --> 10:27.914
It's a secret.

10:29.424 --> 10:31.654
You have a lot of secrets, don't you?

10:32.664 --> 10:34.224
I do, don't I?

10:34.964 --> 10:36.484
What's with the two of you?

10:36.764 --> 10:41.104
Miss Shoko and I made a wish.
On the wishing stones.

10:41.104 --> 10:42.704
Wishing stones?

10:42.704 --> 10:45.574
Oh, you mean those things
out by the camphor tree?

10:45.844 --> 10:47.344
The heck did you wish for?

10:47.344 --> 10:48.674
It's a secret.

10:48.674 --> 10:51.544
Well, what did YOU wish for, Shoko?

10:51.644 --> 10:53.744
Huh? I...

10:54.414 --> 10:56.574
Well, I...

10:56.754 --> 10:58.514
World peace, maybe?

11:03.094 --> 11:05.024
Gimme a break!

11:06.124 --> 11:08.934
Come on, cut it out! Lame!

11:08.934 --> 11:11.304
What then? World domination?

11:11.304 --> 11:13.234
Yeah, that might be it!

11:17.904 --> 11:19.064
My stomach hurts!

11:33.924 --> 11:36.154
He's cute, isn't he?

11:37.024 --> 11:39.924
Sort of the type that brings out
a girl's maternal instincts.

11:41.294 --> 11:42.384
Um...

11:43.564 --> 11:45.004
Well...

11:45.004 --> 11:46.404
Are you Hiro's...

11:47.064 --> 11:50.304
Are you and lokawa...

11:50.304 --> 11:52.004
Guilty as charged!

11:52.474 --> 11:54.234
I'm just kidding.

11:54.514 --> 11:58.344
Hiro's a regular at the coffee shop I run.

11:58.684 --> 12:02.204
Those two are classmates,
so he just tags along as a favor.

12:06.984 --> 12:09.594
You, on the other hand, really go for it, huh?

12:09.594 --> 12:13.764
You dated him, right? And you seem
so bound and determined!

12:13.764 --> 12:15.924
Coming all the way to this little town...

12:16.234 --> 12:19.964
Feel free to talk to me about anything, okay?
I'll be glad to give you advice.

12:20.874 --> 12:22.164
You're completely wrong!

12:24.904 --> 12:27.774
My moving to Kanocho was just coincidence!

12:28.044 --> 12:30.644
It was a long time ago, and I have
no intention of trying anything!

12:30.644 --> 12:32.074
And he!

12:33.344 --> 12:36.444
By now, he wouldn't...

12:38.384 --> 12:39.584
Um...

12:40.154 --> 12:41.784
Did something happen?

12:42.024 --> 12:43.654
Not at all, not at all.

12:44.724 --> 12:45.784
But...

12:47.164 --> 12:49.264
Really, it was nothing.

12:49.264 --> 12:51.764
Nothing for a child to worry about, anyway.

12:51.764 --> 12:54.574
Yeah, that's right. It was grown-up talk.

12:54.574 --> 12:58.134
I'll tell you about it once you're a little older.

12:58.474 --> 12:59.464
Okay?

13:00.244 --> 13:01.804
All right...

13:16.454 --> 13:19.154
She hates being treated like a child, does she?

13:38.014 --> 13:41.014
Iokawa Household
Our List of Promises

13:41.014 --> 13:42.954
- No fighting
- Always be polite
- No secrets
- Eat meals together

14:12.044 --> 14:15.984
Our List of Promises
- Breakfast Duties
Odd-numbered days: Karada
Even-numbered days: Hiro
- Trash Duties
Burnables: Karada (Tues, Fri)
Unburnables: Hiro (Thurs)
And separate them!

14:34.104 --> 14:38.544
- Always be polite
- No secrets
- Eat meals together
- Don't treat people like kids

14:40.674 --> 14:43.044
It's already been four years, huh?

14:46.144 --> 14:46.344
Um...

14:46.344 --> 14:46.914
Hiro!
Um...

14:46.914 --> 14:47.574
Hiro!

14:49.014 --> 14:51.484
It's about time to be heading back.

14:51.484 --> 14:52.544
Okay!

15:07.704 --> 15:10.534
Raw
Sea Urchin
Cookies

15:15.214 --> 15:16.404
Let's get these.

15:17.784 --> 15:19.744
I'm sure they'll look good on you.

15:23.554 --> 15:25.524
Thank you very much!

15:27.254 --> 15:29.824
Beach
Souvenir Shop

15:29.824 --> 15:31.264
Beach
Souvenir Shop
Miss Shoko!

15:31.264 --> 15:34.924
Beach
Souvenir Shop

15:36.894 --> 15:38.234
How do they look?

15:38.234 --> 15:42.104
Hiro bought them for me. What do you think?

15:44.874 --> 15:46.394
They look very good on you.

15:47.574 --> 15:49.134
Very childlike.

16:01.054 --> 16:02.184
Iokawa!

16:20.104 --> 16:21.334
Iokawa...

16:22.944 --> 16:24.444
What happened?

16:24.444 --> 16:26.274
It must be nice being you, Amino.

16:28.014 --> 16:30.984
You're so big and tall...

16:35.094 --> 16:38.114
L-Look, lokawa...

16:38.764 --> 16:41.494
If you like, how about we go
see a movie tomorrow?

16:42.994 --> 16:46.834
Sometimes I even get mistaken
for a college student.

16:46.834 --> 16:50.204
So it'll be like being accompanied
by a guardian! Right?

16:51.044 --> 16:52.734
It's a school day.

16:53.674 --> 16:55.074
Tomorrow.

16:56.114 --> 16:59.774
Oh. It is, huh?

17:04.114 --> 17:07.024
You're the same as always. Aren't you, Amino?

17:11.324 --> 17:13.924
Ah. Tomorrow, huh?

17:13.924 --> 17:15.764
That's right!

17:22.304 --> 17:25.274
Well, I have to see the youngster here off, so...

17:25.274 --> 17:26.604
See you, lokawa.

17:26.604 --> 17:28.904
Okay! See you at school tomorrow.

17:37.054 --> 17:38.284
Karada...

17:39.154 --> 17:40.244
Yes?

17:41.054 --> 17:43.084
Please go on ahead back home.

17:43.594 --> 17:44.824
What about you, Hiro?

17:45.324 --> 17:47.524
I have to talk to Nogami about something.

17:51.664 --> 17:51.864
Kanocho Station

17:51.864 --> 17:53.364
Kanocho Station
Okay...

17:53.364 --> 17:57.604
Kanocho Station

18:00.974 --> 18:04.204
Kanocho Station

18:08.884 --> 18:13.254
It's been a long time since
I've said something like that to her.

18:14.424 --> 18:16.654
So you like your eggs salty.

18:19.994 --> 18:21.554
I didn't know that.

18:22.434 --> 18:27.664
Because I... I've never cooked for you.

18:31.374 --> 18:35.864
Four years ago, you suddenly
disappeared from my life.

18:37.214 --> 18:40.974
I believed you when you said
you'd be back soon...

18:47.724 --> 18:49.694
It was for her.

18:50.454 --> 18:53.054
You broke up with me
because of that girl, didn't you?

18:54.864 --> 18:57.164
She's my only sister.

18:57.164 --> 18:57.834
IOKAWA Hiro
Karada

18:57.834 --> 18:59.134
IOKAWA Hiro
Karada
I had no idea!

18:59.134 --> 19:00.834
I had no idea!

19:00.834 --> 19:03.864
Why didn't you tell me you had a younger sister?

19:04.874 --> 19:06.134
Well?!

19:17.854 --> 19:19.524
Shoko...

19:19.524 --> 19:21.814
Do you still love me, even now?

19:32.864 --> 19:34.424
Screw you.

20:08.904 --> 20:10.804
Why did this happen?

20:10.934 --> 20:13.434
Why did it have to be this town?

20:13.574 --> 20:15.904
Why did he have to be here?

20:51.414 --> 20:54.674
IOKAWA Hiro
Karada

20:58.854 --> 21:01.754
- Always be polite
- No secrets
- Eat meals together
- Don't treat people like kids
- Answer loud and clear
- Cleaning up should be
properly done

22:14.194 --> 22:20.434
Wearing unfamiliar shoes

22:20.434 --> 22:25.164
Each step a pain that I endure

22:26.604 --> 22:32.884
And yet I walk

22:32.884 --> 22:37.684
Because I have a place to return to

22:38.454 --> 22:46.594
I stare at myself

22:46.594 --> 22:51.194
And notice something I'd lost

22:54.334 --> 23:00.504
I want to be with you

23:00.504 --> 23:07.214
To feel it, near and far

23:07.214 --> 23:13.084
To keep creating each normal day

23:13.084 --> 23:19.724
With you, my beloved

23:19.724 --> 23:27.154
To say "I'm home,"
remove my shoes and hold you

23:27.404 --> 23:32.234
My sweet home

23:44.684 --> 23:47.514
I didn't understand what had happened.

23:48.194 --> 23:51.024
I couldn't believe my own eyes.

23:51.724 --> 23:54.694
To think that the person
in front of me was Miss Shoko...

23:54.834 --> 23:57.954
That the person reflected in the mirror was me...

23:59.034 --> 24:02.194
But the truth is, I knew.

24:02.374 --> 24:05.204
I knew why this had happened...

24:05.544 --> 24:07.704
